# The cli suite's cases a sandbox's environment fails, one name a line, as the runner says them after its ✗.
avra check — the sound check is part of what a check is kept under / a package checked twice without the sound check / the second check is answered from the first
avra check — the sound check is part of what a check is kept under / a package checked without the sound check, then with it / a second sound check is answered from the first sound one
commands/explain / `--stats` / each family says how many of its asks were served and how many computed
commands/explain / a declaration by its name / every answer keyed by it is explained, its signature among them
commands/explain / a package checked, and nothing edited since / `--why` of a file opens with its hold, then its answers, and leaves the store as it stood
commands/explain / a package checked, then a module's file edited / `--why` of an answer names the moved input it reads
commands/explain / a target that names nothing in the package / an answer the check never derives is refused
commands/explain / a target that names nothing in the package / an answer with no subject is refused as one the check never derives
commands/explain / an inspection / every form asked twice prints the same thing
commands/explain — held files / a package a check has just read / a file added to a module it reads, naming nothing it reaches, holds it
commands/explain — held files / a package a check has just read / a seat's consumed mark moving names the one contract line it changed, then and now
commands/explain — held files / a package a check has just read / an edited file is read, because its text moved
commands/explain — held files / a package a check has just read / an untouched module names nothing moved
commands/explain — held files / a package a check has just read / every file is held
commands/explain — sites / a body that cannot be a direct write / a parameter is an open input: the tree path
commands/explain — sites / a body that cannot be a direct write / two places stay on the tree, and each leaf is direct
commands/explain — sites / a body that reads nothing / its one site is constant and hoists
commands/explain — sites / a body that reads one place / a call that reaches exactly that place is direct to it too, through the callee
commands/explain — sites / a body that reads one place / its site is a direct write to that place
